OL,3,AHow Shein lost its shine ahead of
OL,4,Along-awaited stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FFast-fashion giant Shein is set to make
OL,7,Fits highly anticipated stock market
OL,8,Fdebut on Tuesday as it lists in Hong
OL,9,FKong after a years-long quest to go
OL,10,Fpublic.
OL,12,FIt comes after failed attempts to list
OL,13,Fin the US and UK, as concerns were
OL,14,Fraised over issues including the firm's
OL,15,Flabour practices and its environmental
OL,16,Fimpact.
OL,18,FOnce estimated to be worth nearly
OL,19,F$100bn (#74bn), Shein is now valued at
OL,20,Faround a quarter of that figure, as the
OL,21,Ffirm faces other issues like increased
OL,22,Fcompetition and global trade tensions.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
