OL,3,AHow Shein lost its shine ahead of
OL,4,Along-awaited stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FShein has grown hugely popular,
OL,7,Fespecially with younger customers, due
OL,8,Fto its ability to source the very
OL,9,Flatest fashions at ultra-low prices
OL,10,Fthrough a vast network of factories in
OL,11,FChina.
